- Changed GitOps to reset every setting omitted from `org_settings` and fleet `settings` to its default, including `gitops`, `host_expiry_settings`, and `smtp_settings`. `fleetctl generate-gitops` now outputs `gitops` and `smtp_settings`, and `fleetctl gitops` warns before resetting `smtp_settings`, `gitops`, or `server_settings` values. A blank `smtp_settings.password` keeps the password stored in Fleet.
- Changed `GET /api/v1/fleet/config` to return `smtp_settings` (with the password masked) to users with the global GitOps role.
